WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.060
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:09.820
What...

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.680
are you?

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.780
Souta!

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.570
A tanuki...

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.490
You're a tanuki...

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.590
Even for a tanuki,

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:41.250
I'm sure being alone for so very long

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.630
must be quite a sad thing...

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.030
No way. A shapeshifting tanuki? There's no way!

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:07.710
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.300
Episode 2: "Kotoden"

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.940
<i>Surely it's gone by now, right?</i>

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.140
The shapeshifting tanuki!

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:49.230
H-Huh?!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.510
H-Hey, what are you—

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.290
Hold it right there!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.610
Ya varmint!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:00.000
<i>In that instant,</i>

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.360
<i>Granny had the eyes of a hunter.</i>

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:05.740
Tsk! Got away from me, it did.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.870
Something wrong, ma'am?

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:12.990
Oh, there's been a tanuki
showin' up a lot these days.

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:17.810
In fact, I was on my way here 
when I caught it tearin' up the field.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:18.580
Huh?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.720
So I chased after the varmint.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.260
Thought I'd make me some tanuki soup.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.980
T-Tanuki soup?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.160
Anyhow...

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.350
Here y'are. Shoyumame.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.170
I made up a batch.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.030
Have a little if ya like.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:46.530
<b>Udon</b>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.480
Thank you very much.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.950
It's safe to come out now.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.710
They chase you because you're damaging

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.470
their fields, you know.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:09.810
<b>Gurgle</b>

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.480
<i>Is that its stomach?!</i>

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.030
All right.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:19.650
If you're hungry, you can come to my place.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.850
Souta!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.400
Souta...

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:36.920
Huh?

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.530
You're a boy?!

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.590
Souta!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.510
Bean! Bean!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.630
That's right. Beans.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.530
This dish is called "shoyumame."

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:49.640
Say "ahh."

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.330
It's salty-sweet and good.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.370
Good.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.680
Hey, now! Don't eat with your fingers...

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.080
Hey, now! Rinko! Souta!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.870
Don't eat with your fingers.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:18.330
<i>Mom's shoyumame</i>

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.040
<i>tasted more like candy...</i>

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.810
Souta. Souta.

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:26.040
Souta. Souta.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.520
Souta. Souta.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.540
Huh?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:30.880
All gone.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.470
What?!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.210
You ate all of that?!

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:42.110
<i>I went and let him in the house...</i>

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:47.680
<i>But it's not as if I'm staying here forever.</i>

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.850
<i>Not to mention the house itself will be...</i>

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.570
Don't cry.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.190
You're a boy, aren't you?

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.120
There, there. Good boy, good boy.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.130
Look at your clothes. They're all dirty.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.280
Here goes!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.660
What is this stuff? It's lathering so much!

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:24.150
You look like a different creature!

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:33.520
Wow! You're all soft now.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:37.200
<i>Fluffy... Shiny...</i>

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.000
<i>And golden...</i>

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.730
Fluffy...

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.000
Souta!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.000
But from now on,

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.010
don't show your ears and tail 
in front of anyone but me, okay?

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:55.510
You don't want to be chased 
around like before, do you?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.830
Good. Okay, it'll be our promise.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.480
Pwomise?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.980
That's right. A promise.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.940
Promise you won't let your 
ears and tail show outside.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.600
Pwomise.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.540
Promise.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.460
Pwomise, pwomise,

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.140
pwomise!

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:27.400
Pwomise, pwomise!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:26.920
Oh, I know.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.550
If you think you can keep your promise,

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:32.430
shall we go to town to buy you clothes?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:40.810
<b>Hayashida Dental</b>

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.560
Now we get on the Kotoden.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.940
Hey, that's not safe.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.910
No one's in there.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.320
Here comes the train.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.990
It's okay. There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.070
See? That was no problem.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:27.400
Whoa!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.280
The most fearsome life form came from the edge of space!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.280
<b>A Children's Show:
Together with Gaogao-chan</b>

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.280
<b>The scar on his back is 
the mark of a champion!
The hit show "Gaogao Exercises" 
broadcasts every day, too!</b>

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.280
It has air conditioning?!

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:34.210
It didn't have that back 
when I was in school...

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:38.700
Hey! Don't run!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.940
<i>It's not just the air conditioning.</i>

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.810
<i>The outside of the train cars</i>

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.560
<i>didn't look like that.</i>

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:46.310
<i>They used to be...</i>

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:50.630
<b>Emergency
Exit</b>

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.270
<i>orange and cream-colored.</i>

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:52.630
Hot...

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:57.390
<b>Nakajima 
17 years old</b>

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:57.390
<b>Souta 
17 years old</b>

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.490
So hot...

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:56.620
It's too dang hot today.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.430
Hey, ain't that girl in your class?

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.150
Didn't ya say...

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.980
ya thought she was cute?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.250
Manabe-san, right—

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.490
Idiot! I never said that!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.000
Why don't ya wave to her?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:20.530
Huh?!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.700
But we've hardly spoken...

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.300
G'wan, 'fore the train comes.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.010
All right!

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:44.510
Lucky you.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:45.990
And all thanks to me.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.180
Huh?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.070
Huh?

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:49.950
What?

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.740
Wha...

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.130
Don't cry, man.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:57.430
I'm not.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.140
This is... sweat...

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:04.660
<i>I didn't need to remember that.</i>

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.030
<i>After I just told someone not to cry...</i>

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.750
<i>I wonder if she got married</i>

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.760
<i>and has a child now, just like that...</i>

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.810
Hey, take off your shoes.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:30.690
<i>I guess I'm kind of like a parent myself now.</i>

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.700
Yeah, it goes by fast, huh?

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:47.310
<i>Sky.</i>

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.460
<i>Rice fields.</i>

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:50.910
<i>Mountains.</i>

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:52.570
<i>Houses.</i>

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.270
<i>Greenery.</i>

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:23.410
Relaxing scenery, isn't it?

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.330
Really? This is the one you want?

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.080
But that's a lion!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.000
But isn't that weird, in food chain terms?

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Souta's Mental Food Chain 
Diagram</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Lions</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Carnivores</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Omnivores, Herbivores</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Tanuki</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Plants, Bugs</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:40.220
<b>Seems strong</b>

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.130
Are you sure?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.220
Gaogao-cha'!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:44.230
Well, I guess it doesn't matter...

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.990
There, there. That's a good boy.

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:00.530
Hey! Nozomi!

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:03.950
For pity's sake, what the heck are you doin'?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.570
He's a crybaby!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.280
What are you sayin'? Tell him you're sorry!

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:11.040
I'm so sorry about this. Is he okay?

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.630
He's not hurt, is he?

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:15.600
Ah, no. I think he's fine...

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.540
Are you okay?

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:19.210
I'm sorry, sweetie.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.580
It hurt, didn't it—

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.030
Ah... Huh?

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:26.930
Y-Yes?

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:28.980
Tawara-kun?

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.180
You're Tawara-kun, right?

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:39.860
<i>Huh? Huh?!</i>

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:43.000
M-Manabe-san?

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.780
I got married. It's Tanaka now.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:50.290
<b>Aaaargh</b>

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:50.290
<i>This sort of thing happens too easily 
out here! This is why I hate the sticks!</i>

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.350
What a surprise! What's it been, 
since our coming-of-age?

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:56.290
I went to your family's udon 
restaurant all the time!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.610
Are you back here for good now?

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:00.490
I heard you live in Tokyo.

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:01.750
Oh, well...

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.550
Is that your little one?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:08.450
I'm, uh... taking care of him for a while... 
for a friend, actually.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.060
What's his name?

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:12.170
Huh?

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:15.440
<i>Shoot! I never picked a name!</i>

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.180
Ah, er...

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.670
Uh...

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.820
Souta?

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.620
Er... It's...

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.280
<i>I can't think up a name 
for a kid on the spot!</i>

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.980
<i>Er, no, he's really a tanuki...</i>

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:32.950
<i>All my friends go "pon poko pon no pon..."</i>

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.550
<i>But he looks like an ordinary kid... But...</i>

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.400
Poco... is his name.

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:38.830
Poco-chan?

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.840
<i>I screwed up!</i>

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.190
<i>Why am I always like this?</i>

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.110
Poco!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:50.890
Poco-chan, eh?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.470
What a cute name!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:56.130
This is Eitarou, and that's 
his big sister, Nozomi.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.530
Nice to meet you.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.730
Poco-chan's weird!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:13:59.810
Urk!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:02.610
I-Is he?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.990
He's wearin' a poncho, but it's not rainin'!

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:06.490
<i>That's all?</i>

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.490
Hey, Poco?!

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.670
Honestly, Nozomi!

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.980
I'm so sorry.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.090
I wasn't expectin' to run into ya here.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:18.930
No...

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:20.840
I wasn't, either.

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:21.630
Oh, hey!

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:25.140
Would you like to sit down for some tea?

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:29.600
<i>I thought that a chance 
reunion with a first love</i>

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:33.370
<i>would be more like…</i>

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.760
Okay, one at a time, now!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.760
I want ice cream! Ice cream!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:37.760
Souta!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:41.580
And a fruit sandwich, 
and grapefruit juice, and...

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.630
Souta! Souta!

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.400
Nozomi, you can't eat all that.

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:43.400
Souta! Souta!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.400
Yes, I can!

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.290
I see...

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.070
A lot's happened to you...

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:52.510
It's a pity about the restaurant,

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:56.080
but I guess you're workin' in Tokyo now.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.090
What do you do up there?

00:14:59.390 --> 00:14:59.960
Oh...

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.790
I make videos for Web ads,

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.290
and home pages, and so on.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.250
Wow! Really? That sounds so cool!

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:09.840
Oh, no. It's not as great as it sounds.

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:13.090
It's a life of going back and forth
between home and work...

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.100
Thank you for waiting.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:17.850
Here's the fruit jello.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.350
Jiggle, jiggle!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.900
Okay, ready? Here you go.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:28.740
How is it?

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.530
You took to that fast…

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.990
Do you like fruit?

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:37.660
Here. "Ahh."

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.300
Poco-chan is just precious.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:45.750
Mommy! Feed me, too!

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:48.590
What? You're a big girl now.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.420
You can feed yourself, can't you?

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:54.680
No fair! No fair!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.170
No fair! No fair!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.780
Nozomi! Stop that!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:00.100
No fair! No fair!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.260
What on earth is wrong with you today?

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:07.690
You need to settle down!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:10.200
It's okay.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.200
It's a poncho, so it's fine if it gets wet.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.460
Nozomi-chan, do you want some jello, too?

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.960
Ahh... Ahh...

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:47.140
Good, good.

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.770
Poco-chan. Tawara-kun.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.120
Thanks.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:59.570
Oh, uh, sorry if I overstepped there.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.030
No, ya didn't.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:05.540
Ya know, I would never have guessed 
that Poco-chan isn't yours.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.380
You look like a real family.

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:11.380
Y-You think so?

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:16.820
Actually, I'm not even married yet, 
so I have mixed feelings about that...

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.390
I don't even have a girlfriend.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:21.840
There's no need to rush.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.520
You've got plenty of time.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:28.110
You could do anything.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.830
Me... I've always lived in Kagawa,

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.530
and I already have kids, too.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:34.250
But...

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.190
If I'd gone away to Tokyo,

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:38.560
I might've taken a different path in life.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:44.040
I can't help thinking how nice that would be...

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.810
But you know, when I'm cooking and such,

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.040
Nozomi'll say...

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.830
"Wow! That smells yummy!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.050
I love your cooking, Mommy!"

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:57.460
And when I hear that, well,

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.660
it lifts me up.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:04.700
It reminds me that, 
at the end of the day, I'm happy.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.060
Souta. Souta.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.940
What is that? It's pretty!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:15.440
Isn't that Nozomi-chan's?

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.180
I'll...

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.450
give it to Poco-chan.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.100
Are you sure? Isn't it important to you?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.870
Poco-chan's cute.

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:29.850
So he's special.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.220
Nozomi.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:36.340
Aren't you glad you made 
friends with Poco-chan?

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.470
Poco, when someone gives you 
a present, you say, "Thank you."

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.780
Tank 'oo.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.300
Come on! You can make it!

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.860
Look! The house is in sight.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:01.860
Pwo...mise...

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.540
And we were almost there...

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>Talk about ugly!</i>

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.410
Of course...

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.050
You've been through a lot today.

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:21.140
That'd make anyone fall 
asleep with a weird face.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:26.090
And look at me. I ended up becoming 
"mom friends" with Manabe-san.

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:29.500
If you ever need parenting advice, 
you just text me, ya hear?

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.520
Ya hear?

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:33.300
It's so strange, Poco.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.530
When I'm with you,

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.030
so many things happen...

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:43.200
And I remember a lot, too.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.590
Well, ready to get home?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.530
Up you go...

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.030
You're heavy!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.330
Have you always been this heavy?

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:20.960
<b>Gaogao-chan and</b>

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.960
<b>The Blue Sky</b>

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:26.970
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:26.970
<b>"Gaogao-chan and the Kind Mechanics"</b>

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:23.730
<i>The Tale of Gaogao-chan</i>

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:26.620
<i>and the Kind Mechanics!</i>

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:31.580
<i>Before the kind mechanics, Mimi and Momo,</i>

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:33.800
<i>appeared the most fearsome alien</i>

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:36.490
<i>in the universe, Ipalnemoani Gaogao.</i>

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.220
<i>Wh-Wh-What do we do?</i>

00:21:42.220 --> 00:21:44.650
<i>He's gonna invade Earth!</i>

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:48.090
<i>Maybe he'll leave if we give him rice balls?</i>

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.750
<i>O-Ow, ow, ow, o-ow…</i>

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:53.660
<i>Ow, ow, o-ow…</i>

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.390
<i>I-I-I'm... I-I'm...</i>

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:58.670
<i>b-b-bro...ken...</i>

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:00.220
<i>Gao...</i>

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:04.300
<i>Now I can't go back to my 
planet after I invade Earth.</i>

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.530
<i>Momo, did you hear that?</i>

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:09.300
<i>I sure did. He needs help!</i>

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>Gao...</i>

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:12.470
<i>A friend in need...</i>

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:13.810
<i>...is a friend, indeed!</i>

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:18.690
<i>All fixed, Gaogao-chan!</i>

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:20.310
<i>Gaogao-chan?</i>

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:22.430
<i>Uh-huh! Gaogao-chan!</i>

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:24.890
<i>You made a new friend. How nice!</i>

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:26.200
<i>Eek!</i>

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:29.320
<i>It's much better that way!</i>

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:32.330
<i>Gao...</i>

00:22:32.810 --> 00:22:34.920
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

